## Blogs

### Design

- [Maggie Appleton's blog](https://maggieappleton.com/): digital gardening, anthropology, and generally brilliant!

### Tech

- [Julia Evans](https://jvns.ca/)'s blog: tons of useful content, and Julia is a wonderful teacher.

### Art

- [Dhilan Ramaprasad](https://dhilan.xyz)'s blog: heartbreaking works of staggering genius.
